{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 8, :comments ["<b>And he shall wash. And he shall shave all his hair.</b> A general statement." "<b>And he shall wash in water and be clean.</b> In the evening, as is the rule, and afterward he returns to explain, for this will be after seven days, and so was the rule of seven for Miriam. And he specified that he shall shave all his hair on the seventh day, and he explained \"all his hair\": his head and his beard and his eyebrows, and this word is related to the root of גב."], :book :leviticus, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 14, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["On Your Way" "http://mobile.tora.ws/"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T19:10:02.004488654Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}